Date: Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:47:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 120/121] common: crash reporter under LLAMA_CRASH_REPORT=1 -
 an unhandled-exception filter, SIGABRT, terminate, invalid-parameter and
 pure-call handlers print the code, module+RVA, thread and up to 48 unwound
 frames straight to stderr (no CRT stdio, no heap); optional minidump with
 LLAMA_CRASH_REPORT_DUMP=<dir>; self-test with
 LLAMA_CRASH_REPORT_TEST=av|so|abort|terminate. Off by default: nothing is
 installed without the variable (lab L049, Codex; the lead fixed the dump-name
 literal)

Silent load deaths exit 0xC0000005 inside the first sched_reserve (SiegeLadder runs 4.313); this finds the place.
